# Project-specific Trivy allowlist.
#
# Format: one CVE per line. Add an inline comment explaining WHY each entry
# is here (when does the exception expire? which upstream fix are we waiting
# for? is it dev-only?). Otherwise this file rots into a noise filter.
#
# Re-audit at least quarterly. Empty entries with no comment will be removed
# by the security review.
#
# Examples:
# CVE-2024-12345  # symfony/http-foundation — fixed in 6.4.7; waiting for the
#                 # Shopware update wave (target: 2026-Q2).
